The MIT License above covers the source code in this repository:
pipeline/, src/, scripts/, shared/, and the build tooling.

It does not cover the essays or their Chinese translations.

The English essays are Copyright Paul Graham, published at
https://www.paulgraham.com. All rights reserved.

The Chinese translations in content/articles/ are derivative works of those
essays. They are published here for non-commercial use, each linking back to
the original, under the permission Paul Graham gives in his General FAQ
(https://www.paulgraham.com/gfaq.html): "Sure. Please include the url of the
original, and send me the url of your translation so I can make a link to it."

The translations are not licensed under the MIT License and may not be reused
commercially. To reuse an essay, ask Paul Graham. To report a translation
